Correspondence to: Sijin Li, MD, PhD, Zhifang Wu, MD, PhD, Yan Cheng, MD, PhD and Jianhua Jin, MD, PhD, First Hospital of Shanxi Medical University, No. 85, Jiefang South Rd, Taiyuan 030001, Shanxi Province, China. Email: <email>lisjnm123@163.com</email>; <email>zhifangwu@sxmu.edu.cn</email>; <email>chengyan_1976@163.com</email>; <email>jjh1225@126.com</email>
<break/>
</corresp><fn fn-type="equal" id="jah311401-note-0001"><label>*</label><p>H. Li and Y. Wei contributed equally.</p></fn></author-notes><pub-date pub-type="epub"><day>30</day><month>9</month><year>2025</year></pub-date><pub-date pub-type="collection"><day>07</day><month>10</month><year>2025</year></pub-date><volume>14</volume><issue seq="350">19</issue><issue-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1002/jah3.v14.19</issue-id><elocation-id>e041169</elocation-id><history>
